 it could be if they  wait a few weeks the value goes up  yeah no question you have injuries at  the receiver position and everything  else that that goes on there and teams  are going to be looking for receivers i  immediately though you talked about last  year the patriots trading for sunu and  the 49ers also looked at sunu before  getting emmanuel sanders i look at the  patriots and say could they use an allen  robinson absolutely they could so that  might be a team that you you look at in  a few weeks the bears make a phone call  and say hey what are you willing to give  us for alan robinson he's much better  player than muhammad sanu was can you  give us more than you gave for muhammad  sanew last year so  that would be a team you look at right  away but there are going to be some  receiver injuries and some places that  that alan robinson can go if the bears  don't want to give him what he wants  yeah whether it's injuries in the short  term or whether it's that team that  wants to go all in as the trade deadline  arrives there is some flexibility there  i think the question becomes how  extensively will robinson be used by the  bears once he's made it clear that he  wants out will they find a way to keep  him off the field like jalen ramsey got  several weeks off last year while the  jaguars were figuring out what to do  with him and  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports

